"""
miner_3 cycle 2027-02-16: screen round 20.
Re-validates the 8-factor library (warm-up gate + live drift through 2027-02-15)
and screens fresh round-20 candidates. Admission gates (same as prior cycles):
|IC_h10| >= 0.007, |ICIR_h10| >= 0.084, max_abs_library_correlation < 0.5.

Round-19 candidates re-screened with updated data (results unknown to this cycle):
  above_ma_ratio_60, mom_ratio_20x60, crypto_link_60, lowvol_mom_20x60,
  down_up_beta_ratio_60, corr_dispersion_60, gain_concentration_60, underwater_time_60,
  range_position_20, skew_20d_skip5, trend_r2_60, rate_beta_cond_60x20,
  drawdown_depth_60, safehaven_beta_60, vol_term_ratio_5x20, autocorr_20

Round-20 new candidates (address current regime: vol normalization, momentum
whipsaw on crypto/commodity, bond selloff, WTI crash; designed orthogonal):
  vol_scaled_mom_20    - 20d skip5 momentum / 20d realized vol (Sharpe-style)
  vol_regime_z_20x120  - z-score of 20d vol vs trailing 120d vol distribution
  range_intensity_20   - mean daily (high-low)/close over 20d (intraday range vol)
  volume_surge_5x20    - 5d avg volume / 20d avg volume (participation shift)
  skew_60d_skip5       - 60d return skewness (skip 5), longer tail moment
  tail_asym_20         - right-tail vs left-tail magnitude ratio over 20d
  gap_ratio_20         - mean |open/prev_close - 1| over 20d (overnight gap vol)
  ma_trend_ratio_20x60 - MA20/MA60 - 1 (trend slope ratio)
  us10y_beta_60        - unconditional 60d beta to US10Y (rate sensitivity)
  reversal_5d          - 5d return (short-horizon reversal; direction auto)
"""
import numpy as np
import pandas as pd
from alphacrafter.sim.utils import get_stock_daily_data, get_index_daily_data

WATCH = ["000300.SH", "SPX", "HSI", "N225", "SX5E", "000688.SH", "SOX", "NDX",
